bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_af_non_latin_styles_not_ported_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 af-latin lane (work/webrender-af-latin-hint-20261128): filed with the port. The knot hinter it replaces had the same limit (Latin zones for every glyph), so nothing regressed. Needs a Chrome capture per script as the oracle."
